// Model (M1) of the Rail Transportation System: starting structure (Delivery 1 with the
// corrections CR1 to CR4 of Delivery 2, section 2.2) and the properties of Delivery 2
// (assumptions of section 4.3). Boundary components and global connectors are written as
// they appear in sos.arch. Latencies and periods in ms.
system Rail

constituent CPS "Sistema de Gestión de Puertos del Caribe" owner "Operadores portuarios de la costa Caribe"
constituent PPS "Sistema de Gestión de Puertos del Pacífico" owner "Operadores portuarios de la costa Pacífica"
constituent RTS "Sistema de Transporte Carretero" owner "Empresas transportadoras y operadores de flotas"
constituent RLS "Sistema de Transporte Férreo" owner "Concesionarios férreos"
constituent FTS "Sistema de Transporte Fluvial" owner "Operadores de navegación fluvial"
constituent NCS "Sistema de Coordinación Nacional" owner "Autoridad nacional (transporte, aduanas y control)"

// Boundary components of the other constituents (as in sos.arch)
component CGW "Caribbean Port Gateway" in CPS tier T2 kind software latency 300000
component PGW "Pacific Port Gateway" in PPS tier T2 kind software
component RGW "Road Gateway" in RTS tier T2 kind software latency 200000
component FGW "Fluvial Gateway" in FTS tier T2 kind software
component NCG "National Coordination Gateway" in NCS tier T2 kind software latency 230000

// T1 — Presentation
component CCF "Consola del CCF" in RLS tier T1 kind software
component DMI "Interfaz del maquinista (DMI)" in RLS tier T1 kind hardware_software
component CTF "Consola de terminal férrea" in RLS tier T1 kind software

// T2 — Communication
component LGW "Rail Gateway" in RLS tier T2 kind software
component TRAD "Traductor canónico" in RLS tier T2 kind software translator latency 60
component BRK "Broker de eventos férreos" in RLS tier T2 kind software capacity 250 load 245
component RAD "Radio tren–tierra" in RLS tier T2 kind hardware availability 99.90
component CON "Concentrador de equipos de campo" in RLS tier T2 kind hardware_software availability 99.90

// T3 — Logic
component PLN "Servicio de planificación y despacho" in RLS tier T3 kind software
component SAM "Servicio de autoridad de movimiento (SAM)" in RLS tier T3 kind software availability 99.95 latency 120
component ILK "Enclavamiento" in RLS tier T3 kind hardware_software availability 99.99 latency 300
component TRN "trenes-ms" in RLS tier T3 kind software latency 50
component CRG "carga-ms" in RLS tier T3 kind software
component POS "posicion-ms" in RLS tier T3 kind software latency 50
// Ill-formed (C5): the burst of F-QS7 exceeds the capacity of reservas-ms
component RSV "reservas-ms" in RLS tier T3 kind software capacity 12 load 14

// T4 — Data
component TRNDB "trenes-db" in RLS tier T4 kind software
component CRGDB "carga-db" in RLS tier T4 kind software
component POSDB "posicion-db" in RLS tier T4 kind software
component RSVDB "reservas-db" in RLS tier T4 kind software
component JRU "Registrador jurídico de a bordo (JRU)" in RLS tier T4 kind hardware_software
component HIST "Repositorio histórico operacional" in RLS tier T4 kind software

// T5 — Physical
component OBU "Unidad a bordo" in RLS tier T5 kind hardware availability 99.99 latency 80
component SEN "Sensores de la locomotora" in RLS tier T5 kind physical availability 99.95
component BA "Actuador de freno" in RLS tier T5 kind physical
component APV "Aparatos de vía (agujas y señales)" in RLS tier T5 kind physical
component DET "Detectores de vía" in RLS tier T5 kind physical
component LID "Lector de identificación de vagones" in RLS tier T5 kind hardware

// Internal connectors
connector F_K1 nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Órdenes de planificación y despacho, y consultas de estado"
  : CCF -> PLN
connector F_K2 nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Registro de cargue, descargue y composición, y consultas de reservas"
  : CTF -> CRG, CTF -> TRN, CTF -> RSV
connector F_K3 nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Reserva de capacidad de corredor y terminal para el surco planificado"
  : PLN -> RSV
connector F_K4 nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Composición y disponibilidad de locomotoras y vagones"
  : PLN -> TRN
connector F_K5 nature control_command coupling blocking
  carries "Solicitudes de ruta para el tren que se despacha"
  : PLN -> ILK
connector F_K6 nature event_notification coupling supply
  carries "Resultado de las solicitudes de ruta y ocupación de secciones"
  : ILK -> PLN
connector F_K7 nature event_notification coupling supply
  carries "Estado de rutas, agujas y señales cuando cambian"
  : ILK -> SAM
connector F_K8 nature control_command coupling sink
  carries "Órdenes de posición de agujas y de aspecto de señales"
  : ILK -> APV
connector F_K9 nature data_flow coupling supply
  carries "Paso de trenes y ocupación de secciones, en el formato de cada fabricante"
  : DET -> CON
connector F_K10 nature data_flow coupling supply
  carries "Identificación de vagones y contenedores al entrar y salir de la terminal"
  : LID -> CON
connector F_K11 nature data_flow coupling supply
  carries "Ocupación de secciones de vía en el formato interno, solo cuando cambia (A11)"
  : CON -> ILK
connector F_K12 nature event_notification coupling sink
  carries "Paso de trenes y lecturas de identificación en los accesos de terminal"
  : CON -> BRK
connector F_K13a nature data_flow coupling supply
  carries "Reportes de posición del tren"
  latency 230 period 5000
  : OBU -> RAD -> SAM
connector F_K13b nature control_command coupling supply
  carries "Autoridades de movimiento (límite y velocidad permitida)"
  latency 230 period 5000
  : SAM -> RAD -> OBU
connector F_K14 nature data_flow coupling supply
  carries "Velocidad, distancia recorrida y condiciones físicas del tren"
  : SEN -> OBU
connector F_K15 nature control_command coupling sink
  carries "Órdenes de frenado"
  : OBU -> BA
connector F_K16 nature data_flow coupling supply
  carries "Velocidad permitida, límite de la autoridad e instrucciones a mostrar"
  : OBU -> DMI
connector F_K17 nature data_flow coupling sink
  carries "Datos de a bordo a registrar"
  : OBU -> JRU
connector F_K18 nature event_notification coupling sink
  carries "Posición de los trenes y autoridades otorgadas"
  : SAM -> BRK
connector F_K19 nature event_notification coupling sink
  carries "Salida de tren despachado con su composición; cargue, descargue y custodia"
  latency 25
  : PLN -> BRK, CRG -> BRK
connector F_K20 nature event_notification coupling supply
  carries "Posiciones, llegadas y salidas"
  : BRK -> POS
connector F_K26 nature event_notification coupling supply
  carries "Cargue, descargue y transferencias de custodia (CR1)"
  : BRK -> CRG
connector F_K27 nature event_notification coupling sink
  carries "Eventos operacionales para el histórico (CR1)"
  : BRK -> HIST
connector F_K21 nature event_notification coupling sink
  carries "Posición, eventos de vía, custodia y composición, en el modelo canónico"
  : BRK -> TRAD -> LGW
connector F_K22 nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Lecturas y escrituras de los datos de cada servicio"
  : TRN -> TRNDB, CRG -> CRGDB, POS -> POSDB, RSV -> RSVDB
connector F_K23a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Solicitudes de capacidad, turno y vagones (SoS-K3a, SoS-K7a, SoS-K24a)"
  : LGW -> TRAD -> RSV, LGW -> TRAD -> TRN, LGW -> TRAD -> POS
connector F_K23b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Capacidad, plataforma, ventana y arribo previsto (SoS-K3b, SoS-K7b, SoS-K24b)"
  : RSV -> TRAD -> LGW, TRN -> TRAD -> LGW, POS -> TRAD -> LGW
connector F_K24a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Avisos de convoy de exportación y solicitudes de camiones (SoS-K22a, SoS-K23a, SoS-K25a)"
  : PLN -> TRAD -> LGW
connector F_K24b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Zona, ventana de descargue y citas de retiro (SoS-K22b, SoS-K23b, SoS-K25b)"
  : LGW -> TRAD -> PLN
connector F_K25a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Consulta de estado consolidado de la carga (sale por SoS-K18a)"
  : CRG -> TRAD -> LGW
connector F_K25b nature data_flow coupling supply
  carries "Estado consolidado de la carga consultada (llega por SoS-K18b)"
  : LGW -> TRAD -> CRG

// Global connectors of the Rail Gateway (as in sos.arch)
connector SoS_K3a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Solicitud de capacidad y turno de transferencia camión-tren"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia camión-tren (v1)"
  : RGW -> LGW
connector SoS_K3b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Confirmación de programación y plataforma, o rechazo"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia camión-tren (v1)"
  : LGW -> RGW
connector SoS_K7a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Unidades listas para transferencia patio-tren y solicitud de vagones"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia puerto-tren (v1)"
  : PGW -> LGW
connector SoS_K7b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Confirmación de convoy, capacidad, plataforma y ventana, o rechazo"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia puerto-tren (v1)"
  : LGW -> PGW
connector SoS_K13 nature event_notification coupling sink
  carries "Custodia recibida por el concesionario y composición del tren"
  agreement "Semántica de custodia; clave transferId (P8)"
  : LGW -> NCG
connector SoS_K14 nature event_notification coupling supply
  carries "Posición del convoy, estado del corredor y eventos de vía"
  agreement "Reporte de posición; umbral P6 y clave P8"
  : LGW -> NCG
connector SoS_K18a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Consulta de estado consolidado de la carga en la que participa el concesionario"
  agreement "Contrato de estado consolidado; regla de acceso y tasa P7"
  : LGW -> NCG
connector SoS_K18b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Estado consolidado limitado a su carga; v3: posición y ETA estimadas"
  agreement "Contrato de estado consolidado; regla de acceso y tasa P7"
  : NCG -> LGW
connector SoS_K22a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Aviso de convoy de exportación y solicitud de zona y ventana de descargue"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia puerto-tren (v1)"
  : LGW -> PGW
connector SoS_K22b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Zona de patio, punto y ventana de descargue, o rechazo"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia puerto-tren (v1)"
  : PGW -> LGW
connector SoS_K23a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Solicitud de camiones para retirar unidades en terminal férrea"
  agreement "Contrato de retiro por camión (v1)"
  : LGW -> RGW
connector SoS_K23b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Vehículos asignados y cita de retiro, o rechazo"
  agreement "Contrato de retiro por camión (v1)"
  : RGW -> LGW
connector SoS_K24a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Unidades listas para transferencia patio-tren y solicitud de vagones"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia puerto-tren (v1)"
  : CGW -> LGW
connector SoS_K24b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Confirmación de convoy, capacidad, plataforma y ventana, o rechazo"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia puerto-tren (v1)"
  : LGW -> CGW
connector SoS_K25a nature dependency coupling blocking
  carries "Aviso de convoy de exportación y solicitud de zona y ventana de descargue"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia puerto-tren (v1)"
  : LGW -> CGW
connector SoS_K25b nature data_flow coupling blocking
  carries "Zona de patio, punto y ventana de descargue, o rechazo"
  agreement "Contrato de transferencia puerto-tren (v1)"
  : CGW -> LGW

// Not connectors of the Rail Gateway: written as in sos.arch for the analysis of SoS-QS1.
connector SoS_K5 nature event_notification coupling sink
  carries "Custodia recibida por el transportador; v3: ETA al despachar"
  agreement "Semántica de custodia; clave transferId (P8)"
  latency 40000
  : RGW -> NCG
connector SoS_K32 nature event_notification coupling sink
  carries "Cambio de levante en puertos del Caribe; v3: estado de servicio"
  agreement "Aviso de levante y de estado de servicio (v2, P2)"
  latency 10000
  : NCG -> CGW

// Analyses (Delivery 2, sections 3.6.6, 5 and 8.1)
// SoS-QS1 (M4): the Rail system is one of the consumers that reconcile in parallel (P1), but in
// the starting structure it has no reconciliation procedure, no query limit and no notice
// (Delivery 2, section 6.1): carga-ms, which receives the consolidated state (C5), is unbounded.
// The other stages are those of sos.arch; CGW stands for the other consumers.
analysis SoSQS1M4 scenario "SoS-QS1 (M4)" latency target 900000 :
  RGW, SoS_K5, NCG, SoS_K32, [CGW | CRG = unbounded]
// F-QS3: custody event from carga-ms to the Rail Gateway during the burst (one queue).
analysis FQS3CustodyLatency scenario "F-QS3" latency percentile 99 target 500 :
  F_K19, BRK, TRAD
// F-QS4: authorization cycle (on-board unit counted at both ends, as in Laboratory 4).
analysis FQS4AuthorizationCycle scenario "F-QS4" latency percentile 99 target 1000 :
  OBU, F_K13a, SAM, F_K13b, OBU
// F-QS5: availability of the authorization chain C1 (sensors, on-board unit, radio, SAM).
analysis FQS5AuthorizationAvailability scenario "F-QS5" availability target 99.95 :
  SEN, OBU, RAD, SAM
// F-QS5 with the track: the interlocking and the concentrator in series. Delivery 2 left them
// out because they feed the SAM by supply (section 5, F-QS5), and counted this variant in 8.3.
analysis FQS5WithTrack scenario "F-QS5 (con vía)" availability target 99.95 :
  SEN, OBU, RAD, SAM, ILK, CON
// F-QS2: F-K11 has no cadence nor timestamp (A11), so its silence never becomes a detection.
analysis FQS2SilentConcentrator scenario "F-QS2" latency target 2000 :
  F_K11 = unbounded, ILK
// F-QS7: capacity request answered in series by the three services of C4.
analysis FQS7CapacityRequest scenario "F-QS7" latency percentile 99 target 800 :
  RSV, TRN, POS, TRAD
